              "printed_page": 1342,
              "column": 1
            },
            {
              "type": "bullet",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "Fusion—two separate tooth buds joined to",
              "pdf_page": 1424,
              "printed_page": 1342,
              "column": 1,
              "subheading": "Variation in Tooth Structure/Shape"
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "form an entire single tooth or joined at the",
